{"seq":2,"slug":"render-props-and-hoc","title":"Render Props 与 HOC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/patterns-and-composition/render-props-and-hoc","wordCount":734,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"render-props-与-hoc\">Render Props 与 HOC</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>React 的逻辑复用方案经历了 Mixin → HOC → Render Props → Hooks 的演变。Render Props 通过一个返回渲染结果的函数 prop 把状态交给调用者，HOC 则用包装组件注入额外功能。虽然 Hooks 已是现代首选，但在遗留代码与错误边界、路由守卫等特定场景中，理解这两种模式仍有价值。本章讲解它们的实现、各自的优势与问题，以及如何选择与组合使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨组件逻辑复用的演变\">跨组件逻辑复用的演变</h2><p>React 的逻辑复用方案经历了从 Mixin → HOC → Render Props → Hooks 的演变。虽然 Hooks 是现代首选，但理解 HOC 和 Render Props 在遗留代码和特定场景中仍有重要价值。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[Mixin] --&gt;|被废弃| B[HOC]&#10;    B --&gt;|嵌套问题| C[Render Props]&#10;    C --&gt;|回调地狱| D[Hooks]&#10;&#10;    B -.-&gt;|仍有使用场景| E[错误边界、路由守卫]&#10;    C -.-&gt;|仍有使用场景| F[动态子组件、downshift]\">flowchart LR\n    A[Mixin] --&gt;|被废弃| B[HOC]\n    B --&gt;|嵌套问题| C[Render Props]\n    C --&gt;|回调地狱| D[Hooks]\n\n    B -.-&gt;|仍有使用场景| E[错误边界、路由守卫]\n    C -.-&gt;|仍有使用场景| F[动态子组件、downshift]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"render-props\">Render Props</h2><p>Render Props 是一种通过函数 prop 共享逻辑的技术。组件将自己的内部状态通过函数参数传递给调用者，由调用者决定如何渲染。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"interface MousePosition {&#10;  x: number;&#10;  y: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface MouseTrackerProps {&#10;  children: (position: MousePosition) =&gt; React.ReactNode;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function MouseTracker({ children }: MouseTrackerProps) {&#10;  const [position, setPosition] = useState&lt;MousePosition&gt;({ x: 0, y: 0 });&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    const handleMove = (e: MouseEvent) =&gt; {&#10;      setPosition({ x: e.clientX, y: e.clientY });&#10;    };&#10;    window.addEventListener(&#39;mousemove&#39;, handleMove);&#10;    return () =&gt; window.removeEventListener(&#39;mousemove&#39;, handleMove);&#10;  }, []);&#10;&#10;  return &lt;&gt;{children(position)}&lt;/&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function App() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;MouseTracker&gt;&#10;      {({ x, y }) =&gt; (&#10;        &lt;div&gt;&#10;          鼠标位置: ({x}, {y})&#10;        &lt;/div&gt;&#10;      )}&#10;    &lt;/MouseTracker&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>interface MousePosition {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  x: number;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  y: number;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface MouseTrackerProps {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  children: (position: MousePosition) => React.ReactNode;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function MouseTracker({ children }: MouseTrackerProps) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [position, setPosition] = useState&#x3C;MousePosition>({ x: 0, y: 0 });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const handleMove = (e: MouseEvent) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      setPosition({ x: e.clientX, y: e.clientY });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    window.addEventListener('mousemove', handleMove);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return () => window.removeEventListener('mousemove', handleMove);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;>{children(position)}&#x3C;/>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function App() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;MouseTracker></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {({ x, y }) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          鼠标位置: ({x}, {y})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      )}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/MouseTracker></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"render-props-的优势\">Render Props 的优势</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>动态渲染</td>\n<td>调用者完全控制渲染输出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>明确的数据流</td>\n<td>通过函数参数传递，类型清晰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无命名冲突</td>\n<td>调用者自行解构命名</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"render-props-的问题\">Render Props 的问题</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"// 嵌套地狱&#10;function App() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;MouseTracker&gt;&#10;      {(mouse) =&gt; (&#10;        &lt;WindowSize&gt;&#10;          {(size) =&gt; (&#10;            &lt;ScrollPosition&gt;&#10;              {(scroll) =&gt; (&#10;                &lt;div&gt;&#10;                  Mouse: {mouse.x}, Window: {size.width}, Scroll: {scroll.y}&#10;                &lt;/div&gt;&#10;              )}&#10;            &lt;/ScrollPosition&gt;&#10;          )}&#10;        &lt;/WindowSize&gt;&#10;      )}&#10;    &lt;/MouseTracker&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 嵌套地狱</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function App() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;MouseTracker></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {(mouse) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;WindowSize></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          {(size) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            &#x3C;ScrollPosition></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              {(scroll) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                  Mouse: {mouse.x}, Window: {size.width}, Scroll: {scroll.y}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              )}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            &#x3C;/ScrollPosition></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          )}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;/WindowSize></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      )}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/MouseTracker></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"高阶组件-hoc\">高阶组件（HOC）</h2><p>HOC 是一个接受组件作为参数，返回增强后新组件的函数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"interface WithLoadingProps {&#10;  loading: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function withLoading&lt;P extends object&gt;(WrappedComponent: React.ComponentType&lt;P&gt;): React.FC&lt;P &amp; WithLoadingProps&gt; {&#10;  return function WithLoadingComponent({ loading, ...props }: P &amp; WithLoadingProps) {&#10;    if (loading) return &lt;Spinner /&gt;;&#10;    return &lt;WrappedComponent {...(props as P)} /&gt;;&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface UserListProps {&#10;  users: User[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;function UserList({ users }: UserListProps) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;ul&gt;&#10;      {users.map((u) =&gt; (&#10;        &lt;li key={u.id}&gt;{u.name}&lt;/li&gt;&#10;      ))}&#10;    &lt;/ul&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;const UserListWithLoading = withLoading(UserList);&#10;&#10;function App() {&#10;  return &lt;UserListWithLoading loading={isLoading} users={users} /&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>interface WithLoadingProps {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  loading: boolean;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function withLoading&#x3C;P extends object>(WrappedComponent: React.ComponentType&#x3C;P>): React.FC&#x3C;P &#x26; WithLoadingProps> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return function WithLoadingComponent({ loading, ...props }: P &#x26; WithLoadingProps) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (loading) return &#x3C;Spinner />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return &#x3C;WrappedComponent {...(props as P)} />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface UserListProps {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  users: User[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function UserList({ users }: UserListProps) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {users.map((u) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;li key={u.id}>{u.name}&#x3C;/li></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ))}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const UserListWithLoading = withLoading(UserList);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function App() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;UserListWithLoading loading={isLoading} users={users} />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"类型推断\">类型推断</h3><p>HOC 的 TypeScript 类型推断相对复杂。需要正确处理泛型传递：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function withAuth&lt;P extends object&gt;(WrappedComponent: React.ComponentType&lt;P&gt;): React.FC&lt;P&gt; {&#10;  return function AuthenticatedComponent(props: P) {&#10;    const { user } = useAuth();&#10;&#10;    if (!user) return &lt;Navigate to=&quot;/login&quot; /&gt;;&#10;    return &lt;WrappedComponent {...props} /&gt;;&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;const ProtectedDashboard = withAuth(Dashboard);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function withAuth&#x3C;P extends object>(WrappedComponent: React.ComponentType&#x3C;P>): React.FC&#x3C;P> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return function AuthenticatedComponent(props: P) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const { user } = useAuth();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (!user) return &#x3C;Navigate to=\"/login\" />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return &#x3C;WrappedComponent {...props} />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const ProtectedDashboard = withAuth(Dashboard);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"hoc-的问题\">HOC 的问题</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[HOC 嵌套]&#10;    A --&gt; B[&quot;withAuth(withTheme(withRouter(Component)))&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Props 来源不明&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;组件层级过深&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;Ref 无法穿透&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; F[&quot;静态方法丢失&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[HOC 嵌套]\n    A --&gt; B[\"withAuth(withTheme(withRouter(Component)))\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Props 来源不明\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"组件层级过深\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"Ref 无法穿透\"]\n    B --&gt; F[\"静态方法丢失\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Wrapper Hell</td>\n<td>多个 HOC 嵌套层级过深</td>\n<td>使用 Hooks 替代</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Props 冲突</td>\n<td>多个 HOC 可能注入同名 prop</td>\n<td>命名空间或 Hooks</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ref 丢失</td>\n<td>HOC 阻断了 ref 传递</td>\n<td><code>React.forwardRef</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>静态方法丢失</td>\n<td>HOC 不会复制静态方法</td>\n<td><code>hoist-non-react-statics</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调试困难</td>\n<td>DevTools 中看到大量 wrapper</td>\n<td>设置 <code>displayName</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"何时使用哪种模式\">何时使用哪种模式</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"// ✅ 用 Hooks 替代 Render Props&#10;function App() {&#10;  const { x, y } = useMouse();&#10;  const { width, height } = useWindowSize();&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      Mouse: ({x}, {y}), Window: {width}x{height}&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;// ✅ 用 Hooks 替代 HOC&#10;function ProtectedPage() {&#10;  const { user } = useAuth();&#10;  if (!user) return &lt;Navigate to=&quot;/login&quot; /&gt;;&#10;  return &lt;Dashboard /&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// ✅ 用 Hooks 替代 Render Props</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function App() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const { x, y } = useMouse();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const { width, height } = useWindowSize();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      Mouse: ({x}, {y}), Window: {width}x{height}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ✅ 用 Hooks 替代 HOC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function ProtectedPage() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const { user } = useAuth();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (!user) return &#x3C;Navigate to=\"/login\" />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;Dashboard />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐方案</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>共享有状态逻辑</td>\n<td>Hooks</td>\n<td>最简洁，无额外层级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误边界</td>\n<td>类组件 HOC</td>\n<td>Hooks 不支持 <code>componentDidCatch</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三方库集成</td>\n<td>HOC 或 Render Props</td>\n<td>遗留 API 兼容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态子组件渲染</td>\n<td>Render Props</td>\n<td>父组件需要根据状态动态决定渲染</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>装饰器风格增强</td>\n<td>HOC</td>\n<td>路由守卫、权限包裹</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 新代码优先使用 Hooks。HOC 和 Render Props 主要出现在遗留代码和少数 Hooks 无法覆盖的场景（如错误边界）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"组合使用\">组合使用</h2><p>实际项目中可以混合使用多种模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function DataTable&lt;T&gt;({ data, children }: { data: T[]; children: (item: T, index: number) =&gt; React.ReactNode }) {&#10;  const { sortedData, sortBy, sortDirection } = useSort(data);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;table&gt;&#10;      &lt;tbody&gt;&#10;        {sortedData.map((item, index) =&gt; (&#10;          &lt;tr key={index}&gt;{children(item, index)}&lt;/tr&gt;&#10;        ))}&#10;      &lt;/tbody&gt;&#10;    &lt;/table&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;function UserTable({ users }: { users: User[] }) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;DataTable data={users}&gt;&#10;      {(user) =&gt; (&#10;        &lt;&gt;&#10;          &lt;td&gt;{user.name}&lt;/td&gt;&#10;          &lt;td&gt;{user.email}&lt;/td&gt;&#10;        &lt;/&gt;&#10;      )}&#10;    &lt;/DataTable&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function DataTable&#x3C;T>({ data, children }: { data: T[]; children: (item: T, index: number) => React.ReactNode }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const { sortedData, sortBy, sortDirection } = useSort(data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;table></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;tbody></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {sortedData.map((item, index) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;tr key={index}>{children(item, index)}&#x3C;/tr></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ))}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/tbody></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/table></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function UserTable({ users }: { users: User[] }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;DataTable data={users}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {(user) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;td>{user.name}&#x3C;/td></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;td>{user.email}&#x3C;/td></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      )}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/DataTable></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Render Props</strong> 通过函数 prop 传递状态给调用者，提供灵活的渲染控制</li>\n<li><strong>HOC</strong> 通过包装组件注入额外功能，但存在嵌套、props 冲突、ref 丢失等问题</li>\n<li>现代 React 中，<strong>Hooks 是首选方案</strong>，能解决绝大多数逻辑复用需求</li>\n<li>HOC 仍适用于错误边界、路由守卫等场景；Render Props 适用于动态子组件渲染</li>\n<li>理解这些模式的演变有助于维护遗留代码和理解第三方库的设计</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Render Props 与 HOC","id":"render-props-与-hoc"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"跨组件逻辑复用的演变","id":"跨组件逻辑复用的演变"},{"level":2,"text":"Render Props","id":"render-props"},{"level":3,"text":"Render Props 的优势","id":"render-props-的优势"},{"level":3,"text":"Render Props 的问题","id":"render-props-的问题"},{"level":2,"text":"高阶组件（HOC）","id":"高阶组件-hoc"},{"level":3,"text":"类型推断","id":"类型推断"},{"level":3,"text":"HOC 的问题","id":"hoc-的问题"},{"level":2,"text":"何时使用哪种模式","id":"何时使用哪种模式"},{"level":2,"text":"组合使用","id":"组合使用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"复合组件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/patterns-and-composition/compound-components"},"next":{"title":"无头组件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/patterns-and-composition/headless-components"}}